+### Discount codes
+
+`POST /admin/discount-codes` takes `{"code", "kind", "expires_on", ...}`:
+
+- `code` is 3 to 30 letters, digits and hyphens. Codes aren't case-sensitive, and
+  are stored in upper case.
+- `expires_on` is optional. It's the last date (UK time) the code can be used,
+  e.g. `"2026-08-31"`.
